# Agent: terraform-diagnostics (specialist)
> Stub — full spec: `docs/design/02-specialist-contracts.md §2`

Invoked by coordinator when logs, HCL, or version strings are present. May run in parallel with Source Researcher if Bob approves.

**Returns**: `DiagnosticsOutput` — observations, ranked hypotheses with discriminating checks, and unresolved evidence gaps.
**Must not**: Send customer messages, change severity, spawn sub-agents, or commit memory directly.

