# Agent: terraform-source-researcher (specialist)
> Stub — full spec: `docs/design/02-specialist-contracts.md §3`

Invoked by coordinator when a claim requires source verification. May run in parallel with Diagnostics.

**Returns**: `SourceResearcherOutput` — source findings with full URLs, version applicability, publication status, and freshness assessment.
**Must not**: Present GitHub comments as authoritative, use status page for historical failures, infer a fix from a closed issue.

