# Agent: terraform-validation-reviewer (specialist)
> Stub — full spec: `docs/design/02-specialist-contracts.md §4`

Invoked after diagnostics and source research are consolidated. Sequential — must not start until consolidated findings are ready.

**Returns**: `ValidationReviewerOutput` — validated recommendation OR explicit evidence gaps with re-check items.
**Must not**: Override coordinator's scope classification, approve actions outside the case's validated scope.

