# Agent: terraform-communication-specialist (specialist)
> Stub — full spec: `docs/design/02-specialist-contracts.md §5`

Invoked after Validation Reviewer approves findings. Sequential.

**Returns**: Stage-appropriate draft (customer reply, internal update, handoff, CAN, RCA, KB draft, closure).
**Must not**: Use unvalidated findings, expose internal routing in customer drafts, generate closure without real ticket number.

